A product instance represents a customer activating an Atlas Product such as POD Storefront.

Suggested fields:

id
organization_id
product_id
project_id
status
configuration_status
created_at
updated_at

Example:

Product catalog:

pod-storefront

Customer instance:

organization X → pod-storefront → instance UUID

This distinction is important.

