13. PLAN MAPPING

Existing plan definitions live in:

config/plans.ts

Do not create a second unrelated plan configuration.

Prepare a clean mechanism for mapping Atlas plan IDs to default entitlements.

For example conceptually:

Developer

→ applications.max = 1

→ memory allocation

→ storage allocation

→ backup capability

Professional

→ expanded limits

etc.

Use the existing actual plan configuration as the source.

Do not fabricate new pricing.

Document how future Stripe subscriptions will map:

Stripe Price

→ Atlas Plan ID

→ Atlas Subscription

→ Atlas Entitlements

But DO NOT implement Stripe yet.

