Do NOT create an actual worker.

16. IDEMPOTENCY

Provisioning architecture must support idempotency from the beginning.

A single customer purchase must not eventually become two servers because:

Stripe retries a webhook
a worker retries
an HTTP request is duplicated
a queue redelivers a message

Create appropriate unique constraints/indexes around provisioning idempotency.

Document the intended behavior.

