Database-dependent functionality must fail closed or show configuration-required states.

39. RATE LIMITING NOTE

Phase 2A.1 implemented IP-based rate limiting.

Inspect whether it is process-memory based.

If so:

DO NOT unnecessarily replace it during this phase.

Document that it is suitable only as preliminary/single-process protection and will need distributed/shared rate limiting before horizontally scaled production deployment.

Do not report it as globally distributed protection if it is not.

