TARGET ARCHITECTURE

The foundation created in this phase should support:

Customer
↓
Atlas Identity
↓
Organization
↓
Membership / Role
↓
Subscription
↓
Entitlements
↓
Project
↓
Application OR Atlas Product Instance
↓
Environment
↓
Provisioning Job
↓
Infrastructure Resource
↓
Deployment

Phase 2A.2 stops before any real infrastructure or external billing system is activated.

Build the control-plane foundation now so later phases connect external services to a stable Atlas domain model instead of redesigning Atlas around each provider.